cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use qxlint in your research, please cite it as below.
title: "qxlint: deterministic static checks for Qiskit Primitives V2 workflows"
abstract: >-
  An offline static linter for the workflow errors introduced by the Qiskit
  V1-to-V2 primitives migration: reading counts off the wrong object, using a V1
  field on a V2 result, sampling a circuit that has no measurements, and passing
  a channel value a targeted release has removed. It resolves object identity
  with a small abstract interpreter rather than matching syntax, so it reports
  only facts it can prove, and it never imports or executes the code it
  analyses.
type: software
